  (authors' prior work).
* MMOEA-DC            (`MMOEAC`) — Lin, Q., Lin, W., Zhu, Z., Gong, M., Li, J.,
  Coello, C. A. C., "Multimodal Multiobjective Evolutionary Optimization with
  Dual Clustering in Decision and Objective Spaces", IEEE Transactions on
  Evolutionary Computation, 2021.
* CMMO                (`CMMO`) — Ming, F., Gong, W., Wang, L., Gao, L.,
  "Balancing Convergence and Diversity in Objective and Decision Spaces for
  Multimodal Multi-Objective Optimization", IEEE Transactions on Emerging
